## Example (checkout)

```
domains/checkout/
  types/checkout.types.ts
  schemas/checkout.schema.ts
  lib/checkout-validation.ts
  hooks/use-checkout-wizard-actions.ts
  sections/checkout-address-edit-form.tsx
  components/checkout-address-edit-dialog.tsx
  containers/checkout-shipping.tsx
  checkout.domain.tsx
```
